text @[Tomoya]
text *Yawn*
text I stop my yawn, and keep strolling down the usual path to school.
text The sun is hanging somewhat high, shining down on the road that's void of people.
text The hour hand of the clock is already pointed at 9.
text I am lazily walking toward school with my bag held tight under my armpit and my hands inside my pockets.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, it's just the same as usual.
text I murmur, even though there is nobody else here.
text Classes end at noon today.
text The first period's probably over already, so I guess I'm starting with second period.
text Given how sleepy I am, I should be able to catch a few good naps in the three remaining periods.
text And after lunch... Yeah, I guess I'll go spend time at Sunohara's room.
text *Vroom* *Vrooom*
text @[Tomoya]
text ?!
text A menacing aura approaches from behind me!
text Instinctively, I leap to my right.
text *Swoosh*
text A familiar girl speeds past me, right through the area I once occupied.
text She then brakes suddenly.
text The rear wheel screeches and finally comes to a stop a little farther down.
