text The sunlight shines through the gaps in the leaves onto the stone fence.
text The place is filled with the scent of lush greenery.
text It is also surprisingly secluded from the main campus.
text I often used this place when I ditched class...
text ...but I had never thought such a big event would occur here.
text I step on the grass and hear it being crushed underfoot.
text I slowly walk forward one step at a time.
text My destination is...
text In the distance I see Fujibayashi. She appears to be waiting for someone as she sits on the stone fence.
text She's holding her bag with both her hands; her eyes fixed to the ground.
text She was like this yesterday at the school gate as well.
text "Girlfriend"... huh?
text I take a deep breath and relax my shoulders in preparation for what's to come.
