text I scratch my head and sigh for the bad taste it has left in my mouth.
text Well, I guess this can't be helped...
sound 9JM.aac
text @[Voice]
text Tomoya!
text @[Tomoya]
text Eh?
text A voice yells my name, catching me off guard.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKY13"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
