text I turn around and find Kyou, who is clearly very mad.
text @[Tomoya]
text Kyou...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Were you... spying on us again?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKY14"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKY14.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 9JN.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Who cares about that?! What was that just now?! You really want to be done in, don't you?!
text @[Tomoya]
text Geez, you sure have a bad mouth. You're a girl. Stop saying things like doing people in.
sound 9JO.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Shut up! Ryou was crying! What the hell did you say?!
text @[Tomoya]
text Weren't you listening?
sound 9JP.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I was so far away I couldn't hear you clearly!
text @[Tomoya]
text All I told her was that I can't go out with her.
sound 9JQ.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Wh-Why did you turn her down?! Do you know how much courage it took for her to get to this point?!
sound 9JR.aac
text @[Kyou]
text She didn't sleep at all last night!
text @[Tomoya]
text Geez, you're such a pain... I don't even like her. You think I can go out with her just because I'm asked to?
text @[Tomoya]
text Or what is it? Are you telling me that since she tried so hard and mustered up the courage, I should feel sorry for her and go out with her?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKY20"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
