text W-Well... that's true...
text @[Tomoya]
text If everyone who confessed to someone got their way, then this whole world would be full of couples.
sound 9JU.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Urgh...
text @[Tomoya]
text Let's say we do go out for instance. We'd just break up right away.
text @[Tomoya]
text Don't you think that'd hurt her even more?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKY18A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
