fi
sound 9JV.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...
text Kyou remains silent, likely because there is nothing for her to say.
text I suppose it would be a pain if she did.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, I guess I did something terrible to Fujibayashi...
text @[Tomoya]
text I didn't think she would start crying.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKY23A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
