text @[Tomoya]
text Wait a second... just how far afield are you going to go...?
sound 9K0.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Then I could've picked on you all I wanted.
text Is Sunohara alone not enough for you...?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKY18"
